WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.730
<b>Site of the Nemesis Attack</b>

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.730
What an awful thing
 you've all been through.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.740
Who are you people?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.990
We are travelers whose hearts 
have been touched by your misfortune.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.740
It isn't much,

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.000
but please use this to rebuild.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:02:01.010
<b>Now, Feel the World 
-Resonance-</b>

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:59.470
<i>"Now, Feel the World."</i>

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:08.080
<b>Caislean Merlin Medical Care Facility</b>

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:28.540
Is there...
 Is there really nothing you can do?

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.930
I'm afraid not.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:31.920
Melie! It can't be!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.170
Ocoho!

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.710
You're awake!

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.730
Huh?

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:41.280
Darn it! Don't scare me like that!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.300
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.210
Lord de Gulis just keeps sending 
more flowers every day!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:51.220
And my allergies are absolutely killing me!
 Ow, ow, ow!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.330
I was worried about you, you know!

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:00.910
So that Gysoni came from you?

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.160
Yes! And now I'm exhausted.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.910
Everyone thought Lord Brangoire 
had changed the plan.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:13.580
You might end up being
 terminated, you know?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.920
What?! Why?!

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.110
Why do you think?

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:21.280
You broke formation
 and left your dragon with a child.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:24.980
Everything you did
 violated knight regulations.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:27.890
You've gotta be kidding!

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.810
After all I went through?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.220
Ocoho...

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:35.210
I don't regret disobeying orders, though.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:38.970
I want to be a Knight-sorcerer 
who protects the people!

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:41.820
You don't need to worry, Ocoho.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.530
Mordred! Sagramore!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:45.700
Hey.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:48.490
I'm glad you seem to have recovered.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.090
You can return to the knights tomorrow.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.830
I can? I'm not being terminated?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:58.710
You can thank Mordred for talking
 to the higher-ups on your behalf.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:02.590
Yikes... You saved my butt again.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.220
I need you...

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.720
to stay by my side.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.770
Uh, I mean...
 Because you're an excellent knight.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.500
It'd be a problem for me 
if you weren't around.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.530
Oh...

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:19.170
We said we'd all be ordained
 together, didn't we?

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:21.950
So we can't let you be terminated.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:25.140
But it's not as if you can't become 
a knight if you're terminated.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:27.370
Well, that's true, but...

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.620
You're right!
 The ordination ceremony is soon!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.860
So the ceremony is what everyone's
 getting the town ready for.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.060
That's right.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:48.510
Knights-sorcerers come from all over 
Cyfandir to celebrate with us.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:53.910
Still, it's always a surprise
 to see so many infected people here.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:59.130
They say about one eighth
 of the population here is infected.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:00.270
That many?!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.400
Is there some reason for that?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.700
It wasn't all that long ago.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.930
It used to be customary here
 for each household

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:12.660
to offer their first-born son
 to escape the wrath of the Nemesis.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.170
That's so cruel!

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:19.500
Which is why that custom was abolished 
about two generations ago.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.250
Then what's this ordination ceremony all about?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.550
It's a ritual in which 
Knights-sorcerers of high rank

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.290
find successors and adopt them
 as their own children.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.420
You're making me feel a lot of pressure 
with the ceremony so close.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:33.890
It's no big deal.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.730
There haven't been a lot of apprentices
 in recent years,

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:42.610
so all those ordained are guaranteed 
to be accepted into some family.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:46.400
So you become a knight
 both in name and in reality, huh?

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.530
And this year, it's finally our turn.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.200
That's right.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.540
This time, we'll be
 the ones to protect Cyfandir.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.780
<i>Lord Brangoire?</i>

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.930
The projector seems usable again.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.680
<i>Perfect timing.</i>

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:19.690
<i>We received a report that the Merchant Barons
 have entered our territory.</i>

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.900
<i>If we allowed those vultures
 who sully our nation to run free,</i>

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.450
<i>the great Merlin would 
never forgive us.</i>

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:29.700
<i>We should send a Spectre after them
 as soon as tomorrow.</i>

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:35.080
But that won't stop the farmers 
from trading with outsiders.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.250
<i>Then we need to punish them.</i>

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:43.610
<i>There is no place in Cyfandir
 for those who betray the great Merlin!</i>

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.590
<i>He might be right.</i>

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:49.290
<i>Our guardian, the great Merlin,</i>

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.850
<i>did say that he 
would not divide the land.</i>

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.630
<i>We must protect what he left behind.</i>

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:57.470
<i>Yes.</i>

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:01.340
<i>We, the Faithful of the Hermit.</i>

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.860
<i>Hey! Don't enter here in your original form!</i>

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.050
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:13.320
<i>Getting ready to project another Spectre?</i>

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:17.370
<i>Then we'll also need
 to send out Dullahan tonight.</i>

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.020
Did you find the horned boy?

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.600
<i>He's still nowhere to be found.</i>

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.130
<i>He must've fled.</i>

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.130
No. I can feel his presence.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.090
He must be close by.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.890
But something feels strange.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:37.430
Almost as if he's slipped into a rift in time.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.480
Sheesh.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.300
Failed again, eh?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:28.270
Ow...

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:31.590
I went rampaging like a monster again,
 didn't I?

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:33.490
That's enough for today.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.490
You don't want to kill yourself 
with all this tough training.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.540
Hey, Myr...

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.630
Is it hard to make trees grow like this?

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:47.150
No, unlike you,

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.380
nature is a part of my body.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:54.260
Also, I can't make living trees grow.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.500
But I can use Fantasia with my bare hands,

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.530
so why can't I do things like that, too?

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:02.060
Because you're a human, of course.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.520
And you're not a human?

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:07.270
What are you, then?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.310
The same thing as those guys?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.430
No!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:13.550
Those guys are sort of
 like this forest's memories.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.160
They have no physical forms.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:19.410
Only those who have opened their senses
 to Fantasia can see them.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:23.030
Now that you mention it, I can see
 them better now than I could at first.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.020
I guess I've finally mastered 
the senses of a salmon!

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:31.820
That's "shaman," you dunce!
 And it's nothing to brag about!

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:33.540
Ocoho could already see them,

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.530
and I made it so her two friends
 could see them, too.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:37.550
What?!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:43.390
She has the ability to tune her senses
 to those of others.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.060
She might not realize it, though.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.690
Wow... Ocoho can do that?

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.570
Wait, Myr.
 You still haven't answered me.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.700
If you're not human, then what are you?

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.960
I'm a pixie!

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:11.170
Don't yell in my ears!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.710
Well, you keep making me 
repeat the same thing!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:17.470
You saw my real body in the Sidh,
 didn't you?

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.720
Huh? Your real body?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.050
Behold!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:30.480
Your head popped off?!

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:34.570
I'm telling you, this is my real body!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.280
I'm even wearing underwear here!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.960
What's that body, then?!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.300
It's a fake.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:44.910
A special item made from wood and my own hair,
 the same as your armband.

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:49.230
S-So pixies and stuff really exist?

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:49.920
Well...

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:54.170
Unfortunately, I'm the last of my kind.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.920
Huh? The last of your kind?

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:03.930
<b>[The Little People] 
They are known under various names, but are one race of pixies.
 They are also related to the feather trees...</b>

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:11.160
Pixies are also known as "little people."

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.370
Little people?

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:16.220
They're all capable of changing forms.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.370
They also use Fantasia,

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.030
and they consume it to stay alive.

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:24.610
They use Fantasia? 
Do they just... suck it up?

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:28.670
It's more that 
they submerge themselves in it,

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:31.040
the same way fish swim in water.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:36.750
Wait a sec! Sometimes I feel like 
I'm submerged in Fantasia, too!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.510
Does that mean... I'm a pixie as well?!

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:45.930
Of course you're not a pixie!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.390
If you were, Jill and I would know!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.370
First of all, you don't have wings.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.430
Wings? But you don't have any, either.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:57.580
Well, as far as pixies go, 
I'm still just a child.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.400
How old are you?

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:03.430
In human years...
 I'm about 853 years old.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.410
E-Eight hundred and fifty-three?!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.740
D-Does that mean you've been
 around longer than this country?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:14.040
Indeed! I was born long before 
humans arrived in this land!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.780
Wow!

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:19.710
Then did you know the 
legendary sorcerer Merlin?

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.490
Hah! What's legendary about him?!

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:25.620
He wasn't even a sorcerer!

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:26.590
Huh?

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:31.770
Also, Merlin never wanted this country
 to turn out the way it has!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.780
Because humans expanded their domain 
as if they owned everything,

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:39.570
the once-vast forest has been reduced
 to this size.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:44.030
How much longer will it last?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:48.370
You mean that's why
 all the pixies are gone now?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.660
Not only that.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:53.860
When the forest became so much smaller,

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.650
Fantasia also became sparse.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:02.300
That's when the little people started 
making various odds and ends

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:07.550
to collect the remaining Fantasia 
and circulate it.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:14.670
But the humans changed the way 
those items were used.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:19.870
With no options left, 
the little people chose

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:23.220
not to die out slowly,

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:27.870
but to dissolve into the planet 
and become one with it.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:33.670
So it's our fault 
that you're the only pixie left?

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.960
Come with me.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:40.210
There's something I want to show you.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:01.350
Jill... The Yggdrajill clan

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:07.380
took in many of the pixies
 that dissolved into the planet.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:12.020
She is the love of my life, a goddess, 
and the best wife anyone could want.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:14.530
So... what is it you wanted to show me?

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.070
That.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.180
Those are our children.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:25.630
We had nearly given up on having any.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.090
So more pixies are going to be born?

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:33.360
Yes, though we'll have to wait 
a few years yet.

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:36.770
That's why I can't leave this place.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:41.790
That's also one of the reasons 
why I decided to train you.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:48.240
To understand why, you must first 
defeat the power within you.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.500
Can you do that?

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:51.870
Yeah!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:01.880
Now, listen.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.460
In ancient times, 
when the world overflowed with Fantasia,

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:10.380
humans could control it 
without the use of tools.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:15.980
Do you know what the word "Fantasia" 
means in the ancient language?

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.520
It means "imagination."

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.480
<i>Visualize...</i>

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:45.310
<i>Imagine myself making this work!</i>

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:49.360
Don't forget.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:52.930
A link with Fantasia is 
a link to the world.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.260
How does that help?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.530
Feel it, Seth.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.780
Feel your link with the world.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.660
<i>I'm losing feeling in my whole body.</i>

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:35.570
<i>I can think of only terrible things.</i>

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:40.550
<i>The darkness... 
The hatred is crushing me.</i>

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:46.650
<i>I'm gonna turn into a monster 
that does nothing but destroy... again.</i>

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:04.970
Where's your usual stupid self? 
You're throwing me off!

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:06.610
Doc...

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:10.480
You and I aren't the same.

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:15.070
That's why I know that
 <i>you</i> can do something about it.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.550
Melie...

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:22.930
Seth...

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:27.750
Change... this world...

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.260
Don't become a monster.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.270
I won't!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:06.540
Well done!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:12.290
You finally succeeded 
in binding your freeloader within the Sidh!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:15.550
Then... I'm not in danger anymore?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.050
Yes!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.910
I did it! I did it!

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:26.060
Also, look.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.990
You used Fantasia for creating, 
not for destroying.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:35.320
Just a tiny bit, but it's something.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.520
I... made this?

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.190
When all I did was destroy before?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.410
What are you going to do now?

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.510
I'm going to start over.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.710
I'm starting my search for Radiant again.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.450
I see.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:02.590
Seth, you may be the one 
who can become the pixies' hope.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:08.720
Every time you use Fantasia to create,
 rather than destroy,

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:12.890
the world that was once filled 
with pixies is reborn.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:13.850
Then...

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:17.860
this world will be one 
your kids can easily live in?

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.280
You have a big responsibility.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:23.750
Hey, that's the thing 
I was inside, isn't it?

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.490
Yes, it is.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:29.240
Then they're like my little siblings!

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:32.130
That's true.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:35.120
Nature is all one big family.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.630
"Family," huh? I like that!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.590
I'm gonna try this.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:45.130
I'll show you that
 I can use Fantasia properly.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.510
No, not only that.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:51.370
If I can find Radiant and get rid
 of the threat of the Nemesis,

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:54.330
it'll make life even easier
 for your kids!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.890
That would certainly be worth celebrating.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.460
Later, little sibs.

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:04.650
I'll come see you again.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.930
Don't touch them 
with your dirty hands, human!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.160
Look!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.660
They're moving!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.060
You think they recognize us?

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.550
Of course they do.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:20.040
These little ones know everything.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.920
They seem so happy.

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:25.900
<i>Thanks, Jill,</i>

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.540
<i>for saving me.</i>

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:36.440
<i>You can communicate through the Sidh now?</i>

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:40.940
<i>I'll come back to say "hello" 
before I leave Cyfandir.</i>

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.320
See ya, Myr!

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.270
Thanks for everything!

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:53.370
It's been a long time
 since it was just the two of us.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:54.740
Uh-huh.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:57.710
Oh! A song just came to me!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:02.630
Oh, Jill, goddess of this forest!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:07.720
I wanna get cozy with you!

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:08.220
Oh, honestly, Myr!

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:19.190
The world's all linked together, huh?

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:21.310
All right!

00:22:23.260 --> 00:22:25.990
I'm on my way back, guys!

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.740
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:05.230
<i>The town bustles as the day
 of the ordination ceremony draws near.</i>

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:09.460
<i>In the midst of this,
 Lord Brangoire suspects Ocoho</i>

00:24:09.460 --> 00:24:13.910
<i>of being the one behind the Spectre Nemesis
 appearances and attacks her.</i>

00:24:14.460 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>The one who sees this and stops
 Ocoho from fighting back is Seth.</i>

00:24:20.660 --> 00:24:24.330
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>,
 "The Truth Is Like a Curse."</i>

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Truth Is Like a Curse 
-Ocoho-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>If he had emerged in the wrong year...</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
